WEBVTT

00:00:00.181 --> 00:00:02.771
How to <b>add a new product</b>

00:00:02.822 --> 00:00:07.413
Scan its barcode, or let MiCaja generate one

00:00:07.489 --> 00:00:13.597
Give it a name and a category

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:19.712
Add a photo: from the computer or with your phone camera

00:00:19.792 --> 00:00:23.896
Frame it the way you want before saving

00:00:23.979 --> 00:00:28.347
Cost price, selling price and how many you have

00:00:28.417 --> 00:00:35.019
Save it, and it is ready to sell
